the city, so it was just --

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.026
-Yeah, and all the proceeds are
going to go to 9/11 charities,

00:08:14.026 --> 00:08:15.026
I should say, so --

00:08:15.026 --> 00:08:16.762
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:18.631
Very cool.
-I can't wait.

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:20.065
I'm honored to be part of it.

00:08:20.065 --> 00:08:21.834
I love that you put it together.
That's awesome.

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:23.635
I can't wait to
see you on Sunday.

00:08:23.635 --> 00:08:27.840
"NYC Still Rising After
20 Years: A Comedy Celebration"

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.209
